\'fd\u7901\'3fi quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh cu\u7889\'3fi c\'f9ng vi\u7879\'3fc cho c\'e1c d\u7921\'3f \'e1n vay l\u7841\'3fi.
